course: dictionary
lesson: 7740
title: Which meaning fits?
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one the writer means. «Pumas, also called cougars or mountain lions, chirp, hiss, purr and scream but cannot roar; a mountain lion is not a lion.» The sentence gives you another name for puma, so you can tell it is the same animal.
explain: Look for action words around the new word. «Caimans... sometimes catch and eat capybaras... jaguars, anacondas and pumas hunt them too.» Hunting and eating tell you a puma is a predator, an animal that catches other animals for food.
explain: Always check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. If you read a shirt that says «Puma», a wild cat does not fit, but a sports clothing company does. The context decides.
fact: A puma is a large wild cat of North and South America with a plain sandy-brown coat and a long tail.
fact: A puma is also called a cougar or a mountain lion, so these three words are different names for the same animal.
fact: Pumas live in mountains, forests and deserts, from Canada to the tip of South America.
fact: «Pumas» cannot roar, but they can purr, hiss and scream.
fact: Puma is also the name of a sports clothing company, so the same word can have two meanings.
exercise: «Pumas, also called cougars or mountain lions, chirp, hiss, purr and scream.» What is another name for a puma? | A tall tree | *A cougar | A kind of deer | A sports shirt
exercise: «Jaguars, anacondas and pumas hunt them too.» What does this tell you about pumas? | They grow in water | *They hunt other animals | They only eat grass | They cannot move
exercise: Find and copy the word from «Pumas... chirp, hiss, purr and scream» that means a soft, happy sound, like a cat that is content. | chirp | scream | hiss | *purr
test: Liam reads «Puma» on a sports shirt. Which meaning fits here? | A type of deer | *A sports clothing company | A mountain | A big wild cat
test: Read «...but cannot roar». What sound can a puma NOT make? | Hiss | Purr | Scream | *Roar
exam: Which sentence tells you what a puma is? | A puma is a bird of the desert | A puma is a fish that swims in rivers | A puma is a small pet that sits on your lap | *A puma is a large wild cat of North and South America
